                <p>Source: Department of State, Executive Secretariat, S/S Records, 1986 Nodis Telegrams: Lot 95D23, Algiers Nodis 1986.
                    Secret; Priority; Nodis. Drafted from text provided by the White House; cleared
                    by Joann Alba (S/S–S), McKinley, Zweifel, Johnson, and
                    Robert Pace (S/S–O); approved by Ussery. Sent for information Priority to
                    Rabat.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d157-f2" n="2" xml:id="d157-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d147">Documents 147</ref> and <ref target="#d148"
